==============================================================================
S    : maps R into R (leakage 2.2e-16), diagonal on records: True
Pi_X : maps R into R (leakage 1.9e-16), diagonal on records: True
Pi_Y : maps R into R (leakage 2.6e-16), diagonal on records: True
M_nat = (1+(sqrt3-1) S Pi_X)(1+(sqrt2-1) S Pi_Y) on R: leakage 2.4e-16, ||M_nat - M_L|| = 4.6e-15
  S = (1 + (-1)^N E')/2 with N = sum_s (1 - tau_s);  Pi_X = [N_Q N_q = 0];  Pi_Y = [N_q = 1].
  On R the projector Pi_X contains the 9 q1q2 records and the 3 commutator records (no qutrit letter).
Schmidt rank (Q|q) of the mixed block of M_L     : 2
Schmidt rank (Q|q) of the mixed block of K_L     : 2
Schmidt rank (Q|q) of the mixed block of E'      : 1
Schmidt rank (Q|q) of the mixed block of identity: 1
  A Q|q-product superoperator has a product mixed block (rank 1); class-scalar products therefore have
  |mu(E'-even mixed)| = |mu(E'-odd mixed)|, but M_L needs sqrt2 : 1 and K_L needs 2 : 1.

